 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** The passive ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|shredder_reactive_armor_stack}}
**#* {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**#** Considers attacks from {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, other units' attacks as creeps.
**#** [[Spell damage-based attacks]] neither grant nor increase the stack count.
**#* {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}} {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
**#** [[Instant attack]] sources that cannot proc [[attack modifiers]] neither grant nor increase the stack count:
**#*** {{A|Defiant Shell|Reciprocity}} 
**#*** {{A|Luna|Lunar Orbit}}
**#*** {{A|Medusa|Split Shot}} (without the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}}).
**#*** {{A|Gyrocopter|Flak Cannon}} 
**#*** {{A|Morphling|Waveform}}
**#* Grants 1 stack per successful incoming attack damage instance, regardless of distance.
**#* Each stack has its own buff duration, with each stack buff duration independent of the other.
**# Applies the incoming attack damage instance ([[after reductions]]).
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Adds an active component to Reactive Armor.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Interrupts Timbersaw's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** The active ability effects are applied as follows:
**# Set {{A|Timbersaw|Reactive Armor}} to max stacks.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|shredder_reactive_armor_bomb}} has two main components:
**#* {{Symbol|bonus db-all}}
**#** Grants a {{ValueColor||{{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value2 agh}}|agh}} all [[damage barrier]] upon cast.
**#** Checks for enemy heroes within the radius in {{ValueColor||{{#var:Reactive Armor basic1}}-second|agh}} intervals, within {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value1 agh}}|agh}} radius, centered around Timbersaw.
**#*** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
**#** The barrier then regenerates its barrier capacity per check correspondingly.
**#** {{cf|expr}}
**#*** {{Code|Σ[[Barrier]] {{=}} {{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value2 agh}} + ({{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value3 agh}} + {{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value4 agh}} × f(EnemyHero)) , MAX {{=}} {{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value5 agh}}}}
**#*** {{Code|BarrierRegen <sub>/ Int</sub> {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value3 agh}}*{{#var:Reactive Armor basic1}}}} + {{#expr:{{#var:Reactive Armor type2 value4 agh}}*{{#var:Reactive Armor basic1}}}} × f(EnemyHero)}}
**#** {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
**#*** A countdown timer appears indicating the remaining Reactive Armor duration prior to its explosion. This is visible to everyone.
**#*** Recasting the ability refreshes the max stack duration, and resets the countdown timer.
**# {{Symbol|bonus db-all}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}}
**#* Applies the current damage barrier value as {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} within the radius.
**#* {{M|Dispel|text=Dispelling}} the buff removes the damage barrier, and applies all ability effects prematurely.
**#** When Timbersaw {{M|dies}} while the countdown is active, Reactive Armor immediately explodes, dealing the spell damage within the radius to enemy heroes centered around Timbersaw based on the current capacity value.
**#** This ability component considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
**#** The radius damage is defined as:
**#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} {{#var:Reactive Armor type3 value1 agh}} + ΣCurrent[[Barrier]]}}

{{Illusionnotes
| name = Exposure Theraphy
| desc = The {{M|mana restore}} animations works for Timbersaw's created [[illusions]] for camouflaging purposes.<br><br>However, it is non-functional.
}}

